{
  "key": 8634,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I saw people riding their Bikes\n",
        "and using a log just like a bridge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "...Am I stuck in the bog?\r",
        "Of course not. How silly!\n",
        "This is a full-body mud pack.\r",
        "If it weren’t, I would be squirming\n",
        "and struggling to get out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I caught a rare Pokémon in Pastoria’s\n",
        "Great Marsh.\r",
        "You definitely have to go.\n",
        "I recommend it without hesitation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "We’re on constant patrol.\n",
        "It’s safe here, even at night."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 212\n",
        "Pastoria City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Shards Wanted\n",
        "Technical Machines Offered"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1115_SR212B_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "If you get stuck in the bog, you can\n",
        "count on being there a while.\r",
        "There’s no need to panic.\n",
        "Just struggle and squirm for a bit.\r",
        "Bicycles cannot be ridden on marshy\n",
        "ground, incidentally."
      ]
    }
  ]
}